{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LITTLE SPACEMAN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a universe full of secrets, you take on the role of a brave astronaut in search of space relics. Explore this vast universe, traverse territories, and dodge asteroids while uncovering rare artifacts lost in the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560680/extras/gifone.gif?t=1741194074\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the mysteries of the universe in Story Mode or test your reflexes in Infinite Run. Take on three challenging minigames: <i>All Sides</i> tests your reaction time, <i>Planet Hop</i> requires precision, and <i>Zero-Gravity Pool</i> brings strategic challenges in weightlessness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560680/extras/giftwo.gif?t=1741194074\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story Mode</strong> \u2013 Embark on an immersive journey through the universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relic Collection</strong> \u2013 Discover and catalog unique space artifacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill Tree</strong> \u2013 Enhance your journey with strategic upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Variety of Skins</strong> \u2013 Unlock unique outfits for your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space Challenges</strong> \u2013 Overcome obstacles and prove your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Territory Exploration</strong> \u2013 Conquer and discover new regions of space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress and Achievements</strong> \u2013 Complete objectives and unlock trophies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controller Support</strong> \u2013 Compatible with Xbox 360, Xbox One, Xbox Series X/S, and PlayStation 4/5 (Bluetooth and USB).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Space holds many secrets... are you ready to uncover them?</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560680?t=1741194074","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560680/8b9fe4934d3452c504e6674df4ab980d3ad7df58/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741194074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560680/e87bdd001b02af7151edaccca3018aff60a929bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741194074","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560680/e87bdd001b02af7151edaccca3018aff60a929bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741194074","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LITTLE SPACEMAN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a universe full of secrets, you take on the role of a brave astronaut in search of space relics. Explore this vast universe, traverse territories, and dodge asteroids while uncovering rare artifacts lost in the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560680/extras/gifone.gif?t=1741194074\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the mysteries of the universe in Story Mode or test your reflexes in Infinite Run. Take on three challenging minigames: <i>All Sides</i> tests your reaction time, <i>Planet Hop</i> requires precision, and <i>